	(text "This circuit implements enough I/O for one bank of digital front ends via an MCP23S17 16-bit I/O expander.\nThis allows them to be controlled using SPI commands at a clock of up to 10MHz.\nNote that the expander may be powered off of 1.8-5.5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
